      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just curious: intuitively, when there are four tiles, I would expect about three fourths of the entries in a bucket point into another tile. Do you know why you observed a much lower ratio (half to two thirds)?",
      "revId": "067cbba72755dd69b0b4f3d75d8c68c8b3234d3f",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8d842230_99a4a386",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 16,
